    constraint "Only the current queued Interactive ChannelSession replacement attempt may be reclaimed. Its direct parent is a stopped recovery or acknowledged control attempt; human, channel, runner, agent and pinned snapshot stay bound to the original delegation. Reclaim assigns its own new runtime, preserves immutable run origin and purpose, atomically acquires capacity and rechecks current authority."
